# D160 frozen positional baselines (issue #160) are compared byte-for-byte by
# PositionalChainSqlInvariantTests / JoinAliasMixingSeamTests. They must never
# undergo any EOL conversion: with core.autocrlf=true git would otherwise rewrite
# them to CRLF on checkout and break the byte comparison.
tests/nextorm.core.tests/Baselines/** -text
tests/nextorm.sqlite.tests/Baselines/** -text

# ClickHouse F18 geobase fixtures are handed to the server as-is (config.d/geobase.xml plus
# regions_hierarchy.txt / regions_names_{en,ru}.txt through WithResourceMapping) and parsed as
# tab-separated text. A CRLF checkout leaves a trailing \r on every name and on every hierarchy
# line: regionToName then returns "США\r" and the server refuses to load the geobase at all
# (DICTIONARIES_WAS_NOT_LOADED). Never convert these bytes.
tests/nextorm.integration.tests/ClickHouse/Fixtures/** -text
